<main class="home">
    <section class="home-hero">
        <h1><span>Your AI writes it.</span> <span><em>Parachute</em> shows it to you.</span></h1>
        <div class="say">
            <p class="lede">A vault of your own that Claude, ChatGPT or any AI can read and write. The Parachute app shows what is in it: your records, the small screens your AI makes for them, and a home you arrange together.</p>
            <p class="hero-actions"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/docs/use/start/">Get Parachute</a> <a class="link-arrow" href="/docs/">Read the docs</a></p>
            <section class="keep" aria-labelledby="yours">
                <h2 id="yours">Yours to keep</h2>
                <p>Open source (AGPL). The same vault engine runs on Parachute Cloud and on your own machine, and a vault moves between them as a file. Your AI works for you on your records; nothing runs that you didn't allow.</p>
            </section>
        </div>
