                <h2 id="connect">Connect your AI</h2>
                <p>Give it your Parachute's address:</p>
                <div class="addr"><code>https://my.parachute.computer/<wbr>mcp</code></div>
                <p>Then ask it:</p>
                <ol>
                    <li>Make me a reading tracker I can use in Parachute.</li>
                    <li>What did I capture this week? Sort it into the right places.</li>
                    <li>Make me a home screen with my journal and my reading list pinned.</li>
                </ol>
                <p class="more"><a class="link-arrow" href="/docs/use/connect-your-ai/">Claude, ChatGPT and others, step by step</a></p>
